note Exercism-style exercise "square-root": https://exercism.org/tracks/python/exercises/square-root
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note squareroot is the integer square root of n: the largest r with r * r <= n.
note Check it with: sh exercise.sh exercises/square-root
om2
fn squareroot n ulong to ulong
note replace this line with your solution
trap 13
end
